    {
      "body": "Local changed-file pre-commit checks, including registered-test validation, passed. The isolated base-image RED/GREEN results are in the PR description.\n\nThe upstream test workflows are currently blocked before executing tests:\n\n- The repository-wide rebase gate requires `main` commit `a5f07b1241fc`; the requested/current `qwen4-main-squashed` base is `4ccff141dbe992794f9da6c3aa23535b4f72000d` and diverges from that commit.\n- The AMD gates also report a missing maintainer-controlled `run-ci` label.\n\nI have kept this PR based on Qwen4 rather than merging unrelated `main` changes into it. Please advise on the intended CI path for Qwen4-targeted PRs; this is not a request to bypass the repository's maintenance controls.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-09-08T10:43:22Z",
